---
import NewSection from "./NewSection.astro";
---

<section class="padding_sec" id="skills">
  <NewSection text="Skills" color="black" side="left" />

  <div class="skills_info">
    <h2>My skills</h2>
    <p>To be more specific, the following list highlights the skills I have developed through my studies, lectures, and project work. These include both technical competencies and design-related abilities gained through hands-on experience with cases.</p>
  </div>
  <ul class="skills">
    <li><b>Web Development:</b> Visual Studio Code, HTML, CSS, JS, Astro, React, GitHub</li>
    <li><b>Design Tools:</b> Adobe Illustrator, Photoshop, InDesign, Figma</li>
    <li><b>UX/UI:</b> Understanding of user experience and interface design principles</li>
  </ul>
</section>

<style>
  .skills_info {
    padding: var(--space-m) 0 var(--space-m) var(--space-xl);
    max-width: 65ch;

    p {
      padding-top: var(--space-xs);
      line-height: 1.8;
    }
  }

  .skills {
    padding-top: var(--space-s);
    max-width: 65ch;
    margin: 0 auto;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-3xl);
  }

  @media (max-width: 700px) {
    .skills_info {
      padding: var(--space-m) var(--space-xs) var(--space-m) var(--space-xs);
      max-width: 65ch;
    }
  }
</style>
